"coder_notes":"Predominantly paediatric/young-adult HGG/DIPG umbrella (age up to 21, stdAges CHILD+ADULT) but glioblastoma and WHO grade IV glioma are named in the conditions, so coded mixed_glioma_gbm_named. Registered phase is EARLY_PHASE1. Chemotherapy backbones (BABY-POG, HIT-SKK) are described as standard backbone and coded soc_backbone; they are given only in the combination arms. 'etposide' is a typo in the record, moiety coded etoposide. Genomic/biomarker correlative outcomes are predictive-response analyses, not target-engagement; coded no."}
